{"a":[13,13],"h":"<p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"364\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 363.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 33.0 39.7 46.6 55.6 78.0 78.0 87.0 87.0 99.0 105.7 105.7 114.0 114.0 126.7 142.6 142.6 156.0 165.0 180.7 191.3 191.3 198.0 213.7 220.6 228.7 228.7 235.6 235.6 235.6 244.6 251.3 251.3 267.0 267.0 277.6 293.3 293.3 302.3 302.3 309.0 309.0 315.7 322.6 322.6 333.7 340.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 46.6 55.6 126.7 156.0 165.0 180.7 198.0 244.6 277.6 315.7 333.7 340.6 347.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> fîsıltınızın önünde sadakalar takdim etmekten korktunuz ha? - Demek ki ondan sonra bir iki sadaka takdim eden olmuş ise de çok olmamış, fısıltı hevesinin arkası kesilmiş idi, ya'ni sadaka takdim etmekle fukaralığa düşeriz diye korktunuz, necvanızın önünde çok sadakalar takdim edemediniz de münâcattan vazgeçtiniz değil mi <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"130\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 130.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 38.3 45.0 45.0 51.7 67.6 67.6 76.6 84.0 93.0 93.0 100.6 100.6 107.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"38.3 51.7 76.6 107.3 114.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> mademki yapmadınız - yapabileceğiniz halde yapmadınız <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 160.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 37.6 44.3 51.0 69.0 69.0 75.7 75.7 75.7 82.6 90.0 105.7 122.3 129.0 135.7\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 51.0 105.7 129.0 135.7 144.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah da size tevbe ile nazar buyurdu - Kusurunuzu afvedip yine sadaka takdim etmeksizin Peygambere münacatta bulunmanıza müsaade etti. Bunun şükrânesi olmak üzere<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"143\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 143.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 38.3 38.3 52.6 60.0 75.8 82.6 90.8 90.8 99.8 106.6 106.6 113.3 120.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 38.3 113.3 120.0 126.8\" y=\"25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o halde namaza devam edin<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"127\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 126.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 31.4 31.4 42.7 42.7 50.3 57.7 73.4 80.3 88.4 88.4 95.3 95.3 102.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 42.7 102.0 110.3\" y=\"26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve zekâtı verin<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"183\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 182.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.7 39.0 50.3 58.6 75.7 82.6 82.6 82.6 89.3 96.7 112.6 119.3 127.6 127.6 134.3 141.0 141.0 151.6 158.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 39.0 50.3 58.6 75.7 151.6 158.3 166.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve Allaha ve Resulüne itaat eyleyin - gerek meclislerin âdabı ve gerek diğer ahkâm gibi sair emirlerde itaatsizlik yapmayın da iycabını icra ve infaz eyleyin<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"111\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 110.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.0 30.8 30.8 58.6 58.6 65.3 65.3 65.3 72.0 79.6 86.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.6 37.6 86.3 94.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ki Allah habîrdir - haberdardır, bir lâhza ılminden kaçırmaz <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"112\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 112.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 51.0 51.0 57.7 73.6 80.3 89.3 89.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 42.0 57.7 80.3 96.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> her ne yapıyorsanız - gerek zâhirde gerek bâtında, gerek taat, gerek ma'sıyet, gerek fıil gerek terk hepsini bilir. Ona göre karşılığını verir. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"454\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 453.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 21.0 27.7 43.6 43.6 43.6 52.6 52.6 60.7 60.7 67.6 74.3 92.3 92.3 99.0 99.0 99.0 105.7 113.3 129.0 145.6 145.6 159.7 177.7 184.6 184.6 191.3 191.3 199.6 215.3 222.0 222.0 230.3 230.3 237.7 246.0 261.7 272.3 279.0 279.0 288.0 288.0 295.6 311.3 322.6 330.0 330.0 345.7 353.3 369.0 369.0 378.0 385.6 401.3 414.7 426.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.7 67.6 74.3 129.0 159.7 199.6 230.3 237.7 246.0 261.7 288.0 322.6 345.7 353.3 378.0 385.6 437.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p>"}